    "D1_phase": "OBSERVER -- excess centred on LOCAL MIDNIGHT in 2 of 3 high-count cells, in both networks independently. Thermoelastic strain-rate extremes fall at sunrise/sunset (hours 6 and 18), six hours away. This is the sharpest discriminator in the set.",
